{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"She sits, \"This might be an awkward conversation, I was going through some things and I realized something that doesn't sit right with me.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T08:56:57.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878563317369696297","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"The whole being watched thing, that was you right? I didn't remember right away but I went through some notes Eliza took on the event of our capture. I was being watched while we were being help captive...\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T08:59:26.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878563941134000128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"She trails off waiting for Prosser response","created_at":"2021-08-21T08:59:45.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878564022608347166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They nod. \"Trapero was more directly involved in it. I'd tell you to go to them, but...\" they trail off. \"I'll answer what i can.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T09:02:33.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878564725846327296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Vivica nods understanding. \"I want to know why nothing was said or even done on your end to help us? Y'all just watched what they were doing to us.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T09:04:08.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878565122929467403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Her voice is calm but unsure","created_at":"2021-08-21T09:04:30.984000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878565218253410374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They nod once more, slowly. \"We... there are extraordinarily difficult parts to this job. Sometimes having to watch pain and suffering and wait is the hardest one. To say that we did not help would be untrue. We had word that a rescue operation was being mounted, and so we worked to reduce redcoat presence around where you were being held, especially those conscious who were patrolling. But no, we did not help you directly. I am sorry for that, but to do so would have come with much greater costs for many more people.\" They sigh and look out at the horizon, feet in the water.","created_at":"2021-08-21T09:18:16.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878568680009646121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
